    'privacy-policy'=>['title'=>'Privacy Policy','intro'=>'How Guagua National Colleges, Inc. processes information through the GNCILink website.', 'sections'=>[
        ['Scope and responsibility','This notice covers this public information website, its contact form, optional browser features, AI assistant and staff content-management tools. Student Portal links open Microsoft’s sign-in service; admissions and payment guides describe processes and do not themselves collect application documents, accept tuition payments or verify payments on this website. Other school systems and external services have their own notices.'],
        ['Contacting the school','The contact form receives your name, email address, optional subject and message. It sends them to the published contact mailbox so the school can read and respond. Messages pass through the configured email provider, or the host’s mail service. The application temporarily keeps submitted values in a server session to show validation errors after submission; no contact-message database table is used by this form. Avoid sending passwords, health details, financial credentials or unnecessary student information.'],
        ['Browsing and optional features','With visitor-statistics enabled, the site assigns a random browser identifier in a one-year cookie and stores its SHA-256 hash and visit date. Page statistics store normalized page addresses, page titles and counts separately; they do not associate individual page totals with that visitor hash. Personalization uses page interests and active reading time in local browser storage. Feedback reminders store timing and dismissal preferences locally. These optional features can be refused in Privacy & cookie settings.'],
        ['AI assistant and image checking','Before sending a chat question, you choose whether to send it to Google Gemini. A request can include up to six recent conversation turns, page context and relevant published website information. The browser retains recent chat messages in session storage until cleared or the tab closes; the application does not save a chat-transcript database. Short rate-limiting files contain a hash derived from the network IP and request timestamps. Google separately processes sent content under the service arrangements approved by the school. Staff portrait checking can also send resized uploaded photos to Gemini when the configured checker is enabled. This is separate from public chat.'],
        ['Staff accounts and published content','Authorized staff accounts include names, email addresses, roles, account status, password hashes, verification/recovery credentials and login records. Security logs record network IP addresses, actions and times; editor logs/drafts record staff changes. The website also publishes school-managed names, roles, office contacts, organization information, achievements and photographs, which may identify students, staff and community members. Publishing and AI-checking personal images require the school’s applicable permissions and safeguards.'],
        ['Third parties and external links','Optional embedded Google Maps, Facebook page plugins and the Google feedback form contact their providers only after embedded-services permission. The form sends your answers directly through Google to its owner; this website cannot verify a submission from the cross-origin frame. Fonts and website libraries are also delivered by Google Fonts, jsDelivr, cdnjs or other sources used by the page; these requests reveal technical connection information. School Facebook posts may be imported and cached, and authorized staff can publish announcements to the school’s Facebook Page. Email authentication uses the configured mail provider. Password safety checks send the first five characters of a SHA-1 password hash to Pwned Passwords, rather than the password itself. Following Microsoft, banking, GCash, social-media or other external links takes you to those providers.'],
        ['Purposes and lawful grounds',$pending('lawful_bases','The school must approve the lawful ground for each processing purpose, including contact replies, account/security administration, published educational information and photos, AI processing, optional analytics and embeds. Sensitive personal information requires the applicable Section 13 condition. A cookie choice is not consent to unrelated school processing.')],
        ['Storage, recipients and transfers',$pending('providers','Confirm the actual hosting, email, Google Forms, Gemini and Meta accounts/providers, recipients, overseas processing arrangements and applicable provider terms. The repository alone does not establish their locations, contracts or retention practices.')],
