        ['Protection of information','The application uses password hashing, email verification, role-based administration, request-token checks, validated uploads and parameterized queries in its reviewed processing paths. These controls reduce risk but do not guarantee security. Hosting configuration, HTTPS, backups, access controls and staff practices must also be maintained.'],
        ['Your rights and requests','Subject to the Data Privacy Act and applicable exceptions, you may seek information, access and correction, object to processing, request blocking or erasure, and exercise other applicable rights, including portability and damages where the law provides. You may withdraw optional browser permissions at any time. Withdrawal does not automatically delete earlier server records or provider-held data. For records or published content, contact the school’s privacy office; you may also lodge a complaint with the National Privacy Commission.'],
        ['Privacy contact',$settings['contact_office']!==''&&$settings['contact_email']!==''?$settings['contact_office'].' — '.$settings['contact_email']:'REVIEW REQUIRED: supply the school’s accountable privacy office/DPO and a monitored privacy-request email. Do not treat a default or developer contact address as an appointed DPO.'],
