    'terms-of-use'=>['title'=>'Terms of Use','intro'=>'Guidance for using the Guagua National Colleges, Inc. information website.', 'sections'=>[
        ['Website information','GNCILink provides school information, programs, requirements, events, announcements, fees documents, activities and contact routes. Confirm current admissions requirements, schedules, fees and payment instructions with the responsible school office before acting. Reading a page or using the assistant does not enroll you, approve an application, reserve a place or confirm a payment.'],
        ['Responsible use','Use the website and its contact form lawfully and respectfully. Do not attempt unauthorized access, impersonate others, submit malicious files, disrupt services or send unnecessary sensitive personal information. Administrative access is for authorized staff; protect your credentials and do not share verification codes.'],
        ['AI assistant','The assistant may generate incomplete or incorrect answers. Confirm important information with the school. If you choose to use it, your question, recent turns and relevant context may be processed by Google Gemini as explained in the Privacy Policy and the notice beside the chat controls. Do not use it to submit confidential student records, passwords or financial credentials.'],
        ['Links and embedded services','Links and supported embeds may lead to Google, Meta, Microsoft and other providers. Their services, availability and privacy terms are managed by them. The online payment guide gives instructions; this website does not process bank or GCash transactions. Verify payment destinations with the Accounting Office.'],
        ['Content and intellectual property','School materials, branding and uploaded content may be protected by intellectual-property law. Third-party illustrations, fonts, photographs and software retain their respective owners and license conditions, including Storyset credits where shown. Contact the school for permission to reproduce materials beyond uses allowed by applicable law or the relevant license.'],
        ['Privacy and availability','Privacy choices are separate from these terms; using the site does not automatically give consent to optional tracking or unrelated processing. Services may be unavailable during maintenance or technical failures. Nothing here limits rights or obligations that cannot lawfully be excluded under Philippine law.'],
